Learned from, with thanks
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Obsidian 3D Graph plugin, by Alexander Weichart (AlexW00), MIT License
  https://github.com/AlexW00/obsidian-3d-graph
  The 3D Knowledge Graph follows its hover highlight, link particles, local
  graph and settings sections. No code is copied.

Obsidian "3D Semantic Graph" plugin, MIT License
  The 3D Semantic Graph follows its idea of placing notes by their embeddings.

Obsidian's graph view
  The 2D Knowledge Graph's look and settings panel are modelled on it.
  Obsidian is a trademark of Dynalist Inc. This project is not affiliated
  with or endorsed by Obsidian.

Graphify, by Graphify Labs, Apache License 2.0
  https://github.com/Graphify-Labs/graphify
  tools/graphify reads Graphify's output format (graphify-out/graph.json).
  Graphify itself is not included.

